      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Recommendation Request API",
      "Anchor": "recommendation-request-api",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "Usage of this API is restricted to approved partners, subject to limitations via API agreement.\nAll API requests are represented in protocol 2.0.0. Therefore, all API requests require the header X-Restli-Protocol-Version: 2.0.0",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Recommendation Request API",
      "Anchor": "recommendation-request-api",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "With the Recommendation Requests API, you can replicate the full LinkedIn experience around recommendation requests of LinkedIn members.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Create Recommendation Requests",
      "Anchor": "create-recommendation-requests",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Create Recommendation Requests"
      ],
      "Text": "Create a recommendation by issuing a POST that specifies the requestee and notification. You can only send recommendation requests on behalf of the authenticated user.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "code",
      "Section": "Create Recommendation Requests",
      "Anchor": "create-recommendation-requests",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Create Recommendation Requests"
      ],
      "Text": "POST https://api.linkedin.com/v2/recommendationRequest",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "table",
      "Section": "Request Body Fields",
      "Anchor": "request-body-fields",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Create Recommendation Requests",
        "Request Body Fields"
      ],
      "Text": "",
      "Headers": [
        "Field Name",
        "Format",
        "Description"
      ],
      "Rows": [
        [
          {
            "Text": "notification",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          },
          {
            "Text": "",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          },
          {
            "Text": "Notification of this recommendation request.",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "Text": "notification.message",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          },
          {
            "Text": "String",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          },
          {
            "Text": "Message that requester sends to requestee.",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "Text": "notification.subject",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          },
          {
            "Text": "String",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          },
          {
            "Text": "Subject of the message that requester sends to requestee.",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "Text": "previousRecommendation",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          },
          {
            "Text": "optional Urn",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          },
          {
            "Text": "If this recommendation replaces an old recommendation, this field should be the urn of the old recommendation.",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "Text": "requestee",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          },
          {
            "Text": "Urn",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          },
          {
            "Text": "The requestee represented in personUrn.",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "Text": "requesteeEntity",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          },
          {
            "Text": "optional Urn",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          },
          {
            "Text": "The requestee\u0027s entity. For example: urn:li:position:(urn:li:person:, )",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "Text": "requesterEntity",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          },
          {
            "Text": "optional Urn",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          },
          {
            "Text": "The requester\u0027s entity. For example: urn:li:position:(urn:li:person:, )",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "Text": "relationship",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          },
          {
            "Text": "optional String",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          },
          {
            "Text": "Relationship between recommender and recommendee. Can be the following enum values: RECOMMENDER_MANAGED_RECOMMENDEE -\u00A0Relation where the recommender managed the recipient. RECOMMENDER_REPORTED_TO_RECOMMENDEE -\u00A0Relation where the recommendee is more senior that the recipient. RECOMMENDER_SENIOR_THAN_RECOMMENDEE -\u00A0Relation where the recipient is more senior that the recommendee. RECOMMENDEE_SENIOR_THAN_RECOMMENDER -\u00A0Relation where the recommendee is more senior that the recipient. WORKED_IN_SAME_GROUP -\u00A0Relation where both recipient and recommendee worked in the same company. WORKED_IN_DIFFERENT_GROUPS -\u00A0Relation where both recipient and recommendee worked in different groups. WORKED_IN_DIFFERENT_COMPANIES -\u00A0Relation where both recipient and recommendee worked in different companies. RECOMMENDEE_IS_CLIENT_OF_RECOMMENDER -\u00A0Relation where recommendee is a client of the recipient. RECOMMENDER_IS_CLIENT_OF_RECOMMENDEE -\u00A0Relation where the recipient is a client of the recommendee. RECOMMENDER_TAUGHT_RECOMMENDEE -\u00A0Relation where the recipient taught the recommendee. RECOMMENDER_ADVISED_RECOMMENDEE -\u00A0Relation where the recipient advised the recommendee. RECOMMENDER_STUDIED_WITH_RECOMMENDEE -\u00A0Relation where the recipient studied with the recommendee.",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": [
              "RECOMMENDER_MANAGED_RECOMMENDEE -\u00A0Relation where the recommender managed the recipient.",
              "RECOMMENDER_REPORTED_TO_RECOMMENDEE -\u00A0Relation where the recommendee is more senior that the recipient.",
              "RECOMMENDER_SENIOR_THAN_RECOMMENDEE -\u00A0Relation where the recipient is more senior that the recommendee.",
              "RECOMMENDEE_SENIOR_THAN_RECOMMENDER -\u00A0Relation where the recommendee is more senior that the recipient.",
              "WORKED_IN_SAME_GROUP -\u00A0Relation where both recipient and recommendee worked in the same company.",
              "WORKED_IN_DIFFERENT_GROUPS -\u00A0Relation where both recipient and recommendee worked in different groups.",
              "WORKED_IN_DIFFERENT_COMPANIES -\u00A0Relation where both recipient and recommendee worked in different companies.",
              "RECOMMENDEE_IS_CLIENT_OF_RECOMMENDER -\u00A0Relation where recommendee is a client of the recipient.",
              "RECOMMENDER_IS_CLIENT_OF_RECOMMENDEE -\u00A0Relation where the recipient is a client of the recommendee.",
              "RECOMMENDER_TAUGHT_RECOMMENDEE -\u00A0Relation where the recipient taught the recommendee.",
              "RECOMMENDER_ADVISED_RECOMMENDEE -\u00A0Relation where the recipient advised the recommendee.",
              "RECOMMENDER_STUDIED_WITH_RECOMMENDEE -\u00A0Relation where the recipient studied with the recommendee."
            ]
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "Kind": "code",
      "Section": "sample request body",
      "Anchor": "sample-request-body",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Create Recommendation Requests",
        "sample request body"
      ],
      "Text": "{\n    \u0022notification\u0022: {\n        \u0022message\u0022: \u0022Can you write me a recommendation? Thanks!\u0022,\n        \u0022subject\u0022: \u0022Recommendation request!!\u0022\n    },\n    \u0022requestee\u0022: \u0022urn:li:person:444FFF\u0022\n}",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "code",
      "Section": "sample response header",
      "Anchor": "sample-response-header",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Create Recommendation Requests",
        "sample response header"
      ],
      "Text": "X-RestLi-Id: urn:li:recommendationRequest:(urn:li:person:123ABC,123456)",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Retrieve Recommendation Requests",
      "Anchor": "retrieve-recommendation-requests",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Retrieve Recommendation Requests"
      ],
      "Text": "Once a recommendation request has been created, you can retrieve that recommendation request.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "code",
      "Section": "Retrieve Recommendation Requests",
      "Anchor": "retrieve-recommendation-requests",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Retrieve Recommendation Requests"
      ],
      "Text": "GET https://api.linkedin.com/v2/recommendationRequest/urn:li:recommendationRequest:(urn:li:person:123ABC,123456)",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Retrieve Recommendation Requests",
      "Anchor": "retrieve-recommendation-requests",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Retrieve Recommendation Requests"
      ],
      "Text": "Above is the API request represented in pretty print. With X-Restli-Protocol-Version: 2.0.0, you will need to do the following:",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
